msgstr ""

#: frontend/src/components/BuilderAIChatPanel.vue:730
#: frontend/src/components/NoraEditorChat.vue:300
msgid "Build a website for Forno, a wood-fired pizzeria in Lausanne. Warm, rustic-modern feel with big appetizing food photography and a cozy dark-terracotta palette. Sections: a hero with our story, the menu (wood-fired pizzas, small plates, natural wines), a photo gallery, and a visit section with hours and location."
msgstr ""

#: frontend/src/components/BuilderAIChatPanel.vue:760
msgid "Build a website for Groove Vault, a vintage vinyl record store. Retro, textured, warm analog vibe. Sections: a hero, featured new arrivals, the genres we stock, our story, in-store events, and how to find us."
msgstr ""

#: frontend/src/components/BuilderAIChatPanel.vue:753
msgid "Build a website for Slurp, a ramen bar in Geneva. Bold, appetizing, a little playful. Sections: a hero, the ramen menu with descriptions and prices, our origin story, a gallery, and hours and location."
